// PieChart 的具名分组视觉由 UIX 唯一拥有；Rust 内核负责数据摘要、极坐标几何、命中、交互和绘制执行。
<Visual
  name="PIE_CHART_DEFAULTS_VISUAL"
  type="PieChartDefaultsVisual"
  size={180.0}
  holeRadius={0.0}
  labelVisible={true}
  labelPosition={pie_chart_inside_label_position()}
  legend={pie_chart_right_legend_position()}
  padding={0.0}
/>

<Visual
  name="PIE_CHART_LAYOUT_VISUAL"
  type="PieChartLayoutVisual"
  titleHeight={20.0}
  subtitleHeight={16.0}
  chartEdgeInset={4.0}
  legendRowHeight={20.0}
  legendSideMinContent={120.0}
  legendSideRatio={0.35}
  legendSideMin={70.0}
  legendSideMax={140.0}
  legendItemHeight={18.0}
  legendSwatchX={4.0}
  legendSwatchY={5.0}
  legendSwatchSize={8.0}
  legendTextX={16.0}
  legendTextY={3.0}
  centerRatio={0.5}
/>

<Visual
  name="PIE_CHART_LABEL_VISUAL"
  type="PieChartLabelVisual"
  minimumSweepRatio={0.04}
  minimumPercent={3.0}
  fontRatio={0.17}
  minimumFontSize={8.0}
  centroidFactor={0.6666667}
  outsideOffset={10.0}
  radialFontExtentRatio={0.8}
  lineHeightRatio={1.6}
  donutGap={2.0}
  centerFontRatio={0.6}
/>

<Visual
  name="PIE_CHART_CHROME_VISUAL"
  type="PieChartChromeVisual"
  holeBorder={1.0}
  crosshairRadius={4.0}
  crosshairStroke={1.0}
  brushAlpha={48}
  tooltipOffset={12.0}
  tooltipPadding={4.0}
  tooltipEdgeInset={4.0}
  tooltipBorder={1.0}
/>

<Visual
  name="PIE_CHART_TYPOGRAPHY_VISUAL"
  type="PieChartTypographyVisual"
  title={15.0}
  subtitle={11.0}
  legend={10.0}
  tooltip={10.0}
  labelSeparator=" "
  legendSeparator="  "
  percentSuffix="%"
/>

<Visual
  name="PIE_CHART_PALETTE_VISUAL"
  type="PieChartPaletteVisual"
  background={pie_chart_background_color()}
  text={pie_chart_text_color()}
  textSecondary={pie_chart_secondary_text_color()}
  border={pie_chart_border_color()}
  white={pie_chart_white_color()}
  primary={pie_chart_primary_color()}
  elevated={pie_chart_elevated_color()}
/>

<Visual
  name="PIE_CHART_VISUAL"
  type="PieChartVisual"
  defaults={PIE_CHART_DEFAULTS_VISUAL}
  layout={PIE_CHART_LAYOUT_VISUAL}
  label={PIE_CHART_LABEL_VISUAL}
  chrome={PIE_CHART_CHROME_VISUAL}
  typography={PIE_CHART_TYPOGRAPHY_VISUAL}
  palette={PIE_CHART_PALETTE_VISUAL}
/>

<KernelView value={build_pie_chart_view(kernel, PIE_CHART_VISUAL_REF)} />
